text = "The city is expected to see partly cloudy skies today, with temperatures reaching around 29°C. Humidity will remain high at nearly 70%, with moderate winds throughout the day.

There is a moderate chance of rainfall and thunderstorms during the evening. People travelling outdoors are advised to carry an umbrella and keep an eye on local weather alerts.

Looking ahead, tomorrow is expected to remain cloudy, with temperatures between 22°C and 28°C and a higher possibility of light to moderate rainfall."

